  "name": "The Graph of the Poisson Distribution",
  "problem": "The shape of the graph of the Poisson distribution depends on the value of $\\lambda.$ When $\\lambda$ is small, the probability is concentrated at small values of $x.$ When $\\lambda$ is larger, the probability is concentrated at larger values of $x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14121655/assets/a8af371733bd248a4e5ba3bc35199f00414188e9ca033a04dee2a7de4b0a7db4.png)",
